- Scott DA, et al. N Engl J Med (mRNA-1345 RSV vaccine trial) 2023 — strong efficacy data
- **Caveat:** Real-world effectiveness in NHS population still being established; programme was newly initiated 2024-25

**Feasibility:** **Within 1-3 years** — JCVI recommendation made; programme being established

**Barriers:**
- Vaccine cost vs. established flu programme
- Public awareness of RSV risk in older adults relatively low
- Healthcare system co-delivery capacity

**Metrics:**
