- McDonagh TA, et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for the diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J. 2021;42(36):3599–3726. [Confident — verify specific details]
- National Heart Failure Audit (NICOR) — UK-specific audit data on outcomes

